      "settings": {
        "pf_f095c988_value": "We are committed to delighting each customer of ThePhotoStick. We are so confident you will love it, that we offer a no-risk 30-Day Money Back Guarantee, starting at the day of delivery.\n<br><br>Try out our full line of ThePhotoStick products, with no risk! If you have any issues and are not completely satisfied with your purchase for whatever reason, simply contact returns@thephotostick.com or visit our Live Chat support at thephotostick.com.",
        "pf_bb1fbf6c_value": "<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/about-us\" target=\"_blank\">About Us</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;Contact Us</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/policies/terms-of-service\" target=\"_blank\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy</a>",
        "pf_a47ac32f_value": "It’s as easy as 1,2,3!\n\nTo start on Windows:<br>• Plug ThePhotoStick® into an open USB slot.<br>• From File Explorer, double-click on ThePhotoStick®Windows.exe.<br>• Hit ‘Go’!<br><br>To start on Mac:<br>• Plug into an open USB slot.<br>• Double-click on the USB icon labeled as PHOTOSTICK.<br>• Double-click on ThePhotoStick® Mac.<br>• Hit ‘Go’!",
        "pf_c03dd185_value": "I got all my pictures, screenshots and downloads off my phone, tablet and laptop. What a relief. I have had several phones die over the years and so much info was on them. I don't trust drop box or just saving photos on a device, google took ALL of mine and I have no idea where they are. This photo stick is worth every penny.",
        "pf_e6d8aff5_value": "No, that’s what makes it so great! ThePhotoStick® does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>ThePhotoStick® comes with everything it needs — you simply need to plug it into an available USB slot and it’s ready to run.",
        "pf_85ee865a_value": "Don't waste hours of your time trying to find, organize, and backup all your photos and videos.  Let the ThePhotoStick® do the work for you with one simple click.<br><br>Just Click GO.  No lost hours. No missed photos. No Cloud fees.  Do it yourself with ThePhotoStick®.",
        "pf_aaba955a_value": "ThePhotoStick® is compatible with nearly all modern computers using Windows and Mac Operating Systems:\n\nWindows: Windows XP, Windows Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, and Windows 10.\n\nMac: Mac OS X Version 10.7 and later.",
        "pf_976c1022_value": "This SO easy to work with. Simply pug it in, load the small app, and click. Sit back have a coffee or two. (If you are picture hoarder like me a short nap is good) I don't mean to imply it is slow I had a lot of pics.",
        "pf_3e9fea07_value": "Love it love it love it One of the best things I have ever bought to put pictures on I have almost 4000 pictures on in and still have Room to add more easy to work easy to use. Such a great thing to have.",
        "pf_dd71c617_value": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people leave the ThePhotoStick® plugged in and do a quick and easy weekly backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.",
        "pf_82f45720_value": "ThePhotoStick® for Mac and PCs is a small device that instantly backs up your priceless memories WITHOUT the frustration of searching and organizing them yourself!\n",
        "pf_1fbd8bfd_value": "We ship orders out FAST, but we can’t control carrier transit times. Due to COVID-19, orders are taking up to 10-20 days to be delivered depending on the country.\n",
        "pf_812ec173_value": "Never worry about losing files in the cloud or to unknown circumstances like water damage again. ThePhotoStick keeps your photos and videos safe.",
        "pf_03d68dd3_value": "It's easy to use and it searched my computer for pictures and videos. This is so worth getting. It's 128gb and it also has a cover.",
        "pf_74feca20_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(1, 164, 239); font-weight: 700;\">✓&nbsp;</span>Works on all Mac Computers and PCs",
        "pf_5d594bb6_value": "Very easy to use just plug in and that is all your photos organized on the device with organizing tools",
        "pf_ddd7025f_value": "All products are backed by our 30 Day Money Back Guarantee, starting on the day of shipping.\n\n",
        "pf_20250754_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\">✓</span>&nbsp;Keeps Your Files Safe",
        "pf_7af3ad74_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\">✓</span>&nbsp;Backs Up Files Fast\r",
        "pf_d4d0ddbb_value": "Eliminate the headaches of searching, organizing, transferring and saving photos and videos.",
        "pf_30bdc711_value": "Once backup is complete, properly eject the USB and your files will be safely stored away!",
        "pf_46716f7a_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\">✓</span> Super Easy To Use",
        "pf_4842a0b0_label": "What photo file size is used when we say the 128GB version can store 60,000 photos?",
        "pf_6889519c_value": "Simply plug it in to your computer and hit 'Back Up Now' when pop-up appears.",
